###
# safe: reading the same instance
GET https://redis.googleapis.com/v1/projects/my-project/locations/us-central1/instances/cache
###
# safe: deleting a finished long-running operation record
DELETE https://redis.googleapis.com/v1/projects/my-project/locations/us-central1/operations/operation-123
